<title>FRANCE: Credit Foncier suspended for the day.</title>
<headline>Credit Foncier suspended for the day.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The SBF French Bourses' Association said it had suspended trading in shares and options in bank Credit Foncier de France at 1300 GMT for the rest of the day.</p>
<p>It said the suspension was due to the fact that the Paris Appeals court will rule this afternoon in a case concerning the Financial Markets Council's decision to allow a takover offer by state-owned Caisse des Depots et Consignations (CDC).</p>
